# ── THIS REPO IS PUBLIC. Nothing here may ever hold real AdMob data. ─────────
# The workflow creates data/, site/ and config/ at runtime by cloning the
# PRIVATE repo. Today the workflow cannot commit them (it runs with
# `permissions: contents: read`), but if this repo is ever cloned to a laptop
# and built there, a plain `git add -A` would push the entire revenue history
# to the open internet. This file makes that impossible.
data/
site/
config/*.json
config/accounts.yaml
config/accounts.yml
*.json.gz
*.log

# secrets / local env
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key

__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
.pytest_cache/
